WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.600
Safex

00:00:08.242 --> 00:00:12.076
Gangster Charlie has
reappeared in Candy's life.

00:00:12.279 --> 00:00:16.489
And after leaving his last flower
with gratitude,

00:00:16.639 --> 00:00:19.142
He left the hospital.

00:00:20.888 --> 00:00:26.986
The ghost who played cards

00:00:41.942 --> 00:00:44.870
Sister Pony, sister Lane.

00:00:45.020 --> 00:00:49.006
It has been a long time,
how is everything?

00:00:49.383 --> 00:00:52.778
I am on my night duty,
just writing to you while I can.

00:00:52.928 --> 00:00:56.882
There is no one in the hospital,
it's very quiet.

00:00:57.232 --> 00:00:59.050
I am by myself in the room.

00:00:59.293 --> 00:01:01.558
I can't even see a mouse.

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:08.461
Who is there?

00:01:10.871 --> 00:01:12.463
Who is there?

00:01:22.416 --> 00:01:23.508
Who is it?

00:01:24.151 --> 00:01:25.584
Someone there?

00:01:37.197 --> 00:01:38.528
You are...

00:01:39.466 --> 00:01:41.666
You don't look very good.

00:01:42.836 --> 00:01:44.737
You scared me!

00:01:44.947 --> 00:01:47.402
Are you the only one
who is on night shift?

00:01:48.742 --> 00:01:50.402
Are you from this hospital?

00:01:50.552 --> 00:01:51.870
I am a patient
from the internal department,

00:01:52.020 --> 00:01:53.839
I came to take a walk.

00:01:53.989 --> 00:01:57.315
I see,
no wonder I don't recognise you.

00:01:58.285 --> 00:02:01.880
Nurses there wouldn't talk to me,
I was so bored.

00:02:09.830 --> 00:02:10.989
That's amazing!

00:02:11.139 --> 00:02:13.191
I am Tony.

00:02:13.934 --> 00:02:15.333
I am Candy.

00:02:16.203 --> 00:02:18.899
Candy, we should play a game
since it is our first meeting.

00:02:22.576 --> 00:02:25.101
No, I am working.

00:02:27.214 --> 00:02:29.274
You were writing.

00:02:29.424 --> 00:02:30.907
You saw me?

00:02:31.318 --> 00:02:33.650
Come on, hold them.

00:02:34.654 --> 00:02:37.152
- Just one game.
- Right.

00:02:42.195 --> 00:02:43.594
Three of a kind.

00:02:48.401 --> 00:02:49.493
Full house.

00:02:50.837 --> 00:02:52.429
I lost again!

00:02:52.706 --> 00:02:54.032
This time, I will surely win!

00:02:54.182 --> 00:02:56.134
You should give up.

00:02:56.284 --> 00:02:58.074
I will win.

00:03:01.648 --> 00:03:02.872
Four of a kind.

00:03:06.219 --> 00:03:07.516
Straight flush.

00:03:11.925 --> 00:03:13.825
Again!

00:03:15.228 --> 00:03:17.355
Shoot! It's time check the rooms.

00:03:18.665 --> 00:03:21.361
Hey, it's going to be 15 cents.

00:03:22.235 --> 00:03:24.062
Are we playing for cash?

00:03:24.212 --> 00:03:26.401
It gets pretty realistic
when it comes to gambling.

00:03:27.140 --> 00:03:29.501
I have no money.

00:03:29.651 --> 00:03:31.100
You don't have to pay now.

00:03:35.749 --> 00:03:37.910
Candy, surgical department,
15 cents.

00:03:40.253 --> 00:03:42.653
Thanks, see you!

00:03:48.895 --> 00:03:50.055
Tony?

00:03:50.263 --> 00:03:54.131
He didn't look sick,
I wonder what is wrong with him?

00:04:19.459 --> 00:04:21.450
He's not in this room.

00:04:24.113 --> 00:04:27.308
I have never seen you before,
Which department are you from?

00:04:27.458 --> 00:04:30.250
I am a trainee nurse
from surgical department.

00:04:30.453 --> 00:04:31.746
This is Internal Medicine.

00:04:31.996 --> 00:04:36.217
I would like to ask you a favour.

00:04:36.526 --> 00:04:37.552
Why would a nurse
from surgical department...

00:04:37.702 --> 00:04:40.755
want to know about an
internal medicine's patient?

00:04:40.905 --> 00:04:43.799
I am looking for a boy called Tony.

00:04:44.067 --> 00:04:45.193
Tony?

00:04:45.343 --> 00:04:47.232
He is about ten years old.

00:04:50.006 --> 00:04:54.939
I can check by myself
if you are busy.

00:04:56.279 --> 00:04:59.248
You don't trust me?

00:04:59.749 --> 00:05:01.909
It's not that...

00:05:02.118 --> 00:05:03.780
I found him !

00:05:03.953 --> 00:05:05.621
Tony, you said ?

00:05:06.656 --> 00:05:08.521
He died of lung disease last month.

00:05:11.194 --> 00:05:13.526
Died?

00:05:15.498 --> 00:05:18.562
Why do you want to know about him?

00:05:20.036 --> 00:05:22.527
Tony passed away one month ago.

00:05:22.939 --> 00:05:26.102
It can't be,
was I playing with a ghost?

00:05:28.077 --> 00:05:29.408
Candy!

00:05:30.513 --> 00:05:32.310
I think this is yours.

00:05:36.052 --> 00:05:37.045
Where did you find this?

00:05:37.195 --> 00:05:39.418
In the common room, under the table.

00:05:40.523 --> 00:05:45.483
No card games
when you are working, Candy.

00:05:53.436 --> 00:05:54.698
Natalie.

00:05:55.071 --> 00:05:57.365
Were you on night shift
two days ago?

00:05:57.515 --> 00:05:58.566
Yes.

00:05:59.408 --> 00:06:01.469
Did anything unusual happen?

00:06:01.619 --> 00:06:02.870
No.

00:06:03.020 --> 00:06:04.344
Thanks.

00:06:04.580 --> 00:06:07.475
You look bad, what is wrong?

00:06:07.625 --> 00:06:10.077
Nothing.

00:06:10.227 --> 00:06:11.346
Yeah?

00:06:27.470 --> 00:06:31.736
Franny is on night shift tonight,
I am worried.

00:06:34.677 --> 00:06:36.941
I will sleep
with the lights on tonight.

00:06:48.390 --> 00:06:49.880
Franny?

00:06:50.092 --> 00:06:51.185
Natalie?

00:06:51.335 --> 00:06:52.984
It's me.

00:06:54.596 --> 00:06:56.223
Tony!

00:06:56.473 --> 00:06:57.758
Open the door!

00:06:57.908 --> 00:06:59.357
Wait!

00:07:02.104 --> 00:07:03.897
How did you know my room?

00:07:04.047 --> 00:07:06.500
I know everything
about this hospital.

00:07:06.650 --> 00:07:08.543
Let's play!

00:07:10.479 --> 00:07:11.772
Tony

00:07:11.922 --> 00:07:13.940
I went to Internal Medicine
this morning.

00:07:16.952 --> 00:07:19.513
What did the nurse say?

00:07:19.663 --> 00:07:21.954
They have no patient called Tony.

00:07:23.325 --> 00:07:27.227
Looks like I'm exposed, as a ghost.

00:07:27.756 --> 00:07:29.056
Stop playing around.

00:07:29.206 --> 00:07:32.396
I'm not afraid of ghosts.

00:07:33.035 --> 00:07:35.195
Play some cards with the ghost.

00:07:35.345 --> 00:07:39.502
Your room-mate
won't be back until morning.

00:07:51.353 --> 00:07:54.848
You owe me 95 cents altogether.

00:07:54.998 --> 00:07:56.618
I surrender.

00:07:57.092 --> 00:07:59.151
You are the winner.

00:08:00.262 --> 00:08:02.889
See you next time, practice hard.

00:08:03.039 --> 00:08:06.525
Good night!

00:08:38.833 --> 00:08:40.364
Did he just disappear?

00:08:45.673 --> 00:08:47.266
Who is there?

00:08:47.416 --> 00:08:48.501
Shoot!

00:08:48.651 --> 00:08:50.737
- Come down!
- Yes.

00:08:53.414 --> 00:08:57.310
Why were you on the tree
in the middle of the night?

00:08:57.560 --> 00:09:00.313
To investigate about the ghost.

00:09:00.588 --> 00:09:02.081
Listen!

00:09:02.231 --> 00:09:04.237
The nurse from Internal Medicine
told me.

00:09:04.467 --> 00:09:07.686
It is forbidden
to visit the wards?

00:09:07.862 --> 00:09:11.891
You went straight away to Internal
Medicine and asked about a patient.

00:09:12.041 --> 00:09:13.893
That is ridiculous!

00:09:14.043 --> 00:09:16.193
Watch yourself!

00:09:16.343 --> 00:09:17.326
Yes.

00:09:19.173 --> 00:09:22.735
They could be more flexible,
we are colleagues after all.

00:09:22.885 --> 00:09:26.473
Thank you for taking care of my son.

00:09:28.516 --> 00:09:31.883
He should have come
to the hospital earlier.

00:09:39.660 --> 00:09:42.488
Tony has been enduring the pain.

00:09:42.638 --> 00:09:45.430
That's why we didn't notice that
the situation got worse.

00:09:46.834 --> 00:09:48.131
Tony?

00:09:48.536 --> 00:09:50.329
Sorry.

00:09:50.479 --> 00:09:53.373
The boy who passed away
one month ago?

00:09:54.008 --> 00:09:56.636
Did you know Tony Ryan?

00:09:56.886 --> 00:09:59.505
Yes, he is very good with cards.

00:09:59.655 --> 00:10:01.040
Nonsense!

00:10:01.190 --> 00:10:03.515
Tony is a smart student.

00:10:04.085 --> 00:10:07.543
Still as a painting.

00:10:08.289 --> 00:10:10.984
I have said something inappropriate.

00:10:11.926 --> 00:10:15.760
Who exactly is Tony?

00:10:46.627 --> 00:10:48.151
Candy!

00:10:53.067 --> 00:10:54.762
Candy!

00:11:03.277 --> 00:11:04.670
I was waiting for you, Tony.

00:11:04.820 --> 00:11:06.105
Don't try to scare me.

00:11:06.255 --> 00:11:09.375
Tonight I will find out
your true identity.

00:11:09.525 --> 00:11:10.776
I don't think so.

00:11:10.926 --> 00:11:12.250
No.

00:11:12.953 --> 00:11:14.813
Is Tony your real name?

00:11:14.963 --> 00:11:16.747
Of course!

00:11:17.291 --> 00:11:19.486
Tony Charles.

00:11:20.294 --> 00:11:22.626
The surname is different
from that boy who passed away.

00:11:24.231 --> 00:11:27.159
Come, let's play!

00:11:27.309 --> 00:11:29.468
I know you are not a ghost.

00:11:31.138 --> 00:11:33.834
And you are not a patient
from this hospital either.

00:11:34.408 --> 00:11:35.434
Candy...

00:11:35.584 --> 00:11:39.104
I will call the security
if you don't tell the truth.

00:11:39.880 --> 00:11:41.607
Alright!

00:11:41.757 --> 00:11:46.245
Why do you come to hospital
in your pyjamas?

00:11:46.395 --> 00:11:49.915
I won't get suspicious
by wearing pyjamas.

00:11:50.265 --> 00:11:51.958
Cunning !

00:11:52.526 --> 00:11:56.656
You don't just come here
to play cards, do you?

00:11:57.264 --> 00:11:58.754
Right.

00:11:59.266 --> 00:12:02.127
Wandering out at this time...

00:12:02.277 --> 00:12:05.399
Your family
is going to worry about you, isn't it?

00:12:05.739 --> 00:12:09.835
Mom has to work at night.

00:12:09.985 --> 00:12:13.539
I was bored,
so I came to the hospital...

00:12:13.689 --> 00:12:15.507
Just to play cards?

00:12:15.657 --> 00:12:17.049
Enough?

00:12:18.185 --> 00:12:19.545
Candy...

00:12:19.695 --> 00:12:21.679
Where do you live?

00:12:24.358 --> 00:12:25.384
Someone is coming!

00:12:25.534 --> 00:12:27.256
Hide, Tony!

00:12:34.101 --> 00:12:35.329
Doctor Bobson!

00:12:35.736 --> 00:12:36.762
Candy,

00:12:36.912 --> 00:12:41.400
I have got some cakes here,
come over for a cup of tea.

00:12:41.850 --> 00:12:44.171
Ok, thanks.

00:12:44.945 --> 00:12:47.345
You play cards?

00:12:48.849 --> 00:12:50.042
Interesting.

00:12:50.192 --> 00:12:53.086
Since we are not busy tonight,
we shall play cards.

00:12:53.387 --> 00:12:54.713
I...

00:12:54.863 --> 00:12:56.315
What is it?

00:12:56.465 --> 00:12:57.982
Let's go!

00:12:59.860 --> 00:13:02.188
- What's wrong?
- Nothing!

00:13:02.496 --> 00:13:04.088
Let's go.

00:13:14.341 --> 00:13:16.775
Weird, shouldn't it be here?

00:13:21.681 --> 00:13:22.841
Got it!

00:13:24.050 --> 00:13:28.213
These cards are old.

00:13:28.363 --> 00:13:29.614
Yeah...

00:13:29.764 --> 00:13:33.557
Do nurses always play cards?

00:13:34.394 --> 00:13:38.423
No, we use cards for fortune-telling
when we are bored.

00:13:38.573 --> 00:13:40.090
I see.

00:13:40.433 --> 00:13:43.402
Candy, how many cards do you want?

00:13:43.770 --> 00:13:46.398
Two, please.

00:13:49.776 --> 00:13:51.368
That's it for me.

00:14:04.157 --> 00:14:06.785
Pharmacy! I found it!

00:14:23.443 --> 00:14:24.603
Tony?

00:14:25.578 --> 00:14:27.705
I was in Jackson's house,
right downstairs.

00:14:28.181 --> 00:14:31.207
You are disturbing others
at such hours.

00:14:34.854 --> 00:14:36.581
Tony, that bottle...

00:14:36.731 --> 00:14:38.556
Medicine for your heart.

00:14:39.759 --> 00:14:42.990
It is from Mr. Jackson's
nurse friend.

00:14:44.030 --> 00:14:45.793
Such expensive medicine?

00:14:48.101 --> 00:14:50.662
Tony, you didn't...

00:14:50.812 --> 00:14:52.432
She gave it to us.

00:14:52.672 --> 00:14:54.699
What is the name of the nurse?

00:14:54.849 --> 00:14:58.005
Candy, with a lot of freckles
on the face.

00:14:59.045 --> 00:15:00.808
Which hospital?

00:15:02.949 --> 00:15:04.976
St. Joanna hospital.

00:15:05.626 --> 00:15:08.112
Candy from St. Joanna hospital?

00:15:08.262 --> 00:15:10.451
She is a good person.

00:15:13.492 --> 00:15:16.859
To give me such expensive medicine...

00:15:20.032 --> 00:15:24.594
Mom, you won't have to go to the
hospital if you take this medicine.

00:15:26.005 --> 00:15:28.769
I must thank her after I recover.

00:15:29.108 --> 00:15:31.542
That nurse called Candy.

00:15:32.278 --> 00:15:36.307
Did you open the medicine cabinet
when you were on your night shift?

00:15:36.457 --> 00:15:37.308
No.

00:15:37.458 --> 00:15:39.783
But some medicine is missing.

00:15:41.387 --> 00:15:43.347
There is no sign of breaking here,

00:15:43.497 --> 00:15:45.516
I think the cabinet was opened
with a spare key.

00:15:45.666 --> 00:15:47.183
A spare key?

00:15:48.060 --> 00:15:50.421
This medicine is very strong.

00:15:50.571 --> 00:15:51.789
Very strong?

00:15:51.939 --> 00:15:55.623
More than 0.6 grams will be fatal.

00:16:02.708 --> 00:16:05.006
Could it be Tony?

00:16:05.444 --> 00:16:07.004
Any suspicious person?

00:16:07.154 --> 00:16:08.376
Yes.

00:16:11.083 --> 00:16:14.109
Mom, I got some milk and eggs.

00:16:15.421 --> 00:16:17.821
You fell asleep?

00:16:19.525 --> 00:16:21.652
The medicine from the hospital
is working.

00:16:27.633 --> 00:16:29.093
When you were on your night shift...

00:16:29.243 --> 00:16:31.796
how can you let a stranger
to enter the hospital?

00:16:32.546 --> 00:16:34.865
I believe he didn't steal
that strong medicine on purpose

00:16:35.015 --> 00:16:39.104
Maybe he took the wrong medicine.

00:16:39.478 --> 00:16:41.805
If the medicine is taken
without knowing the consequences...

00:16:42.255 --> 00:16:45.479
We should find the boy immediately.

00:16:46.351 --> 00:16:48.645
But we don't have any clues.

00:16:53.158 --> 00:16:54.853
Just these cards.

00:16:55.160 --> 00:16:57.187
Is there any name or address on them?

00:16:57.337 --> 00:16:58.588
No, I...

00:16:58.738 --> 00:17:01.558
Candy is trying to say that...

00:17:01.708 --> 00:17:04.500
maybe someone might recognise them.

00:17:04.836 --> 00:17:07.600
I will go ask around.

00:17:16.314 --> 00:17:19.340
It has been quite a while
since mom had such a good sleep.

00:17:20.552 --> 00:17:23.419
She doesn't seem to be in pain
as usual.

00:17:27.726 --> 00:17:29.159
No one recognized these cards.

00:17:29.494 --> 00:17:32.895
We will have to look house by house.

00:17:33.882 --> 00:17:35.709
Candy, these cards...

00:17:35.859 --> 00:17:37.244
Does it ring any bell to you?

00:17:37.394 --> 00:17:39.246
They are Tony's.

00:17:39.396 --> 00:17:41.016
You know Tony?

00:17:41.890 --> 00:17:45.901
His mother used to stay
in this hospital.

00:17:46.151 --> 00:17:47.825
His mother?

00:17:48.330 --> 00:17:51.358
She seemed to have a heart disease.

00:17:51.508 --> 00:17:53.025
A heart disease?

00:17:53.969 --> 00:17:56.494
Tony took the wrong medicine.

00:17:58.373 --> 00:18:00.705
Why didn't you take the medicine?

00:18:01.009 --> 00:18:02.836
It is so wasteful.

00:18:02.986 --> 00:18:05.175
How are you going to recover
if you don't take the medicine?

00:18:05.981 --> 00:18:07.972
- Here!
- Thanks.

00:18:11.086 --> 00:18:13.316
I guess this is enough.

00:18:15.457 --> 00:18:16.685
Here.

00:18:18.660 --> 00:18:20.317
Thanks.

00:18:20.467 --> 00:18:22.157
You don't need to thank me.

00:18:24.032 --> 00:18:26.364
I was thanking Miss Candy

00:18:26.735 --> 00:18:28.464
Hey! Here.

00:18:39.648 --> 00:18:40.941
Mom.

00:18:41.091 --> 00:18:43.712
This medicine...

00:18:45.286 --> 00:18:47.580
Mom! Spit it out!

00:18:48.089 --> 00:18:49.249
Tony!

00:18:49.824 --> 00:18:52.622
- Candy!
- Let's take her to the hospital!

00:19:08.910 --> 00:19:10.434
Doctor...

00:19:11.646 --> 00:19:14.574
We made it in time.
It's alright now, Tony.

00:19:14.724 --> 00:19:16.276
Is mom alright?

00:19:17.385 --> 00:19:20.354
Tony, come to my room.

00:19:21.322 --> 00:19:24.957
Let’s play one game, if you win...

00:19:25.199 --> 00:19:27.592
I will pay for your mom's
so that she can stay in the hospital.

00:19:29.764 --> 00:19:31.324
Doctor Bobson!

00:19:31.474 --> 00:19:32.559
But...

00:19:32.934 --> 00:19:34.894
I can't afford the medical fees,

00:19:35.044 --> 00:19:39.065
it's better to discuss
with the doctors and the nurses.

00:19:39.240 --> 00:19:44.177
I can't allow your mom
to leave the hospital.

00:19:44.679 --> 00:19:47.746
Mom does not want
to cause any inconvenience.

00:19:48.416 --> 00:19:49.709
Candy.

00:19:49.859 --> 00:19:53.279
Do you want to be a nurse for money?

00:19:53.429 --> 00:19:54.912
No.

00:19:55.523 --> 00:19:58.518
The same for me.

00:19:58.668 --> 00:20:00.420
Do you understand, Tony?

00:20:00.870 --> 00:20:01.989
Yes!

00:20:02.296 --> 00:20:06.025
Money does not separate patients.

00:20:06.175 --> 00:20:08.461
Life is precious.

00:20:08.611 --> 00:20:10.596
We don't discriminate against anyone.

00:20:10.746 --> 00:20:13.970
We treat everybody equally.

00:20:14.642 --> 00:20:16.166
I think so.

00:20:20.614 --> 00:20:22.614
Three of a kind.

00:20:25.119 --> 00:20:27.019
Full house!

00:20:28.756 --> 00:20:31.987
I am no different from Candy!

00:20:39.200 --> 00:20:42.294
Tony's mother didn't have money
to receive medical treatment.

00:20:42.870 --> 00:20:48.365
Candy was surprised.

00:20:49.310 --> 00:20:50.503
But...

00:20:50.653 --> 00:20:55.007
The kindness that Doctor Bobson
treated his patients with

00:20:55.157 --> 00:20:57.846
makes Candy even more grateful.

00:20:59.153 --> 00:21:01.147
She has decided...

00:21:01.297 --> 00:21:08.060
to give more care and love
to every patient.
